ames>JD</given-names></name><name><surname>Winn-Deen</surname><given-names>ES</given-names></name><name><surname>Yamashiro</surname><given-names>CT</given-names></name><name><surname>Cann</surname><given-names>HM</given-names></name><name><surname>Lai</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Holden</surname><given-names>AL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A 3.9-centimorgan-resolution human single-nucleotide polymorphism linkage map and screening set</article-title><source>Am J Hum Genet</source><year>2003</year><volume>73</volume><fpage>271</fpage><lpage>284</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12844283</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1086/377137</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>